      "text": "This short Costa Rica itinerary combines San José, Tortuguero National Park, the Doka coffee plantation and La Paz Waterfall Gardens. The main part of the trip focuses on the nature of the Caribbean coast: Tortuguero's canals, tropical forests, birds and an early outing at dawn.",
